			'The pointer can be dressed like the rest of the desk, and each set is a silhouette as well as a paint. Bold is the chunky classic arrow and hand. White is a slim needle with thin chevron resize arrows. Outline is a hollow wireframe. Neon is an angular cutout with a robotic hand, a spinner and a reticle. Pastel is a rounded blob with a mitten and a four-dot busy ring. Mono is a pixel staircase with a blocky hand and square arrows. High Contrast is an oversized yellow block arrow in a heavy black outline, for the times the ordinary arrow is hard to find. System keeps the machine\'s own cursors. Each is drawn with a halo, so one set reads on a near-white and a near-black desktop.',
